    {
      "source": "Base class for implementations of <a href=\"../EntityInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>EntityInformation</code></a>. Considers an entity to be new whenever\n<a href=\"../EntityInformation.html#getId(T)\"><code>EntityInformation.getId(Object)</code></a> returns null or the identifier is a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#isPrimitive()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Java primitive</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../EntityInformation.html#getId(T)\"><code>EntityInformation.getId(Object)</code></a> returns zero.",
      "translation": "这是 <a href=\"../EntityInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>EntityInformation</code></a><a href=\"../EntityInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\">接口</a>实现的基类。每当<a href=\"../EntityInformation.html#getId(T)\"><code>EntityInformation.getId(Object)</code></a>返回 null，或者标识符是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#isPrimitive()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Java 基本类型</code></a>且<a href=\"../EntityInformation.html#getId(T)\"><code>EntityInformation.getId(Object)</code></a>返回零时，该实体被视为新实体。",
      "count": 1
    },
